{
  "title": "Light Lacquer-Glazed Jamaican Avocado Bowl",
  "description": "A pungent and springy Jamaican dish featuring avocado, lacquer-glaze, and a variety of spices. The iron teppan serves as the perfect vessel to bring together these vibrant flavors.",
  "cuisine": "Jamaican",
