  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the iron teppan to medium-high heat.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together honey, light soy sauce, brown sugar, and Jamaican jerk seasoning.",
    "Reduce heat to medium and add coconut oil to the teppan.",
    "Add the grated ginger and cook for 1-2 minutes, until fragrant.",
    "Reduce heat to low and add unsalted butter to the teppan.",
    "Add the sliced avocados to the teppan and cook for 2-3 minutes on each side, until slightly tender.",
    "Brush the lacquer-glaze over the avocado halves.",
    "Transfer the avocado halves to a plate and top with steamed jasmine rice, chopped scallions, and chopped cilantro.",
    "Garnish with additional scallions and cilantro, if desired.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!",
    "Optional: sprinkle with toasted sesame seeds or chopped fresh mint for added flavor and texture."
  ],
